OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FFog and mist generally lift,
OL,6,Fthough it may linger all day in
OL,7,Fplaces, leaving a dry and bright day
OL,8,Felsewhere. Winds remaining light and
OL,9,Ffeeling rather mild especially where
OL,10,Ffog clears.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FLow cloud and patchy rain
OL,13,Farrive in the north late on, pushing
OL,14,Fsouthwards. In southern areas mist and
OL,15,Ffog patches develop by early morning.
OL,16,FA chillier night than Friday night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
